    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628610/extras/84e6eb1902843387d4ce323f703365d4.avif?t=1750421869\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Rock Valley</strong>, a small mining town that hides secrets as dark as the depths of its tunnels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Gaslighters</i></strong>, you play as a character mysteriously confined to an apartment surrounded by toxic mist. Your only connection to the outside world? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old radio that spits out vital information and coded messages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628610/extras/c6d4fed5502ca3d6c4cc044547599d22.avif?t=1750421869\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the threads of truth before the gas takes over everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From within the cage, watch - and listen - as Rock Valley story unfolds through the mist. As your resources grow ever thinner, find a way in the unknown and live to see tomorrow. <strong>Connect with the town</strong>, <strong>weight your options</strong> and <strong>pick sides</strong>. See through the lies and leave your name in the city's history... unless it was written in it already.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage scarce resources, solve the gloomy plot behind Rock Valley's historic mine, and do not become your worst enemy in doing so. <strong>Every day might be your last</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628610/extras/84e6eb1902843387d4ce323f703365d4.avif?t=1750421869\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Rock Valley</strong>, a small mining town that hides secrets as dark as the depths of its tunnels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Gaslighters</i></strong>, you play as a character mysteriously confined to an apartment surrounded by toxic mist. Your only connection to the outside world? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old radio that spits out vital information and coded messages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628610/extras/c6d4fed5502ca3d6c4cc044547599d22.avif?t=1750421869\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the threads of truth before the gas takes over everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From within the cage, watch - and listen - as Rock Valley story unfolds through the mist. As your resources grow ever thinner, find a way in the unknown and live to see tomorrow. <strong>Connect with the town</strong>, <strong>weight your options</strong> and <strong>pick sides</strong>. See through the lies and leave your name in the city's history... unless it was written in it already.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage scarce resources, solve the gloomy plot behind Rock Valley's historic mine, and do not become your worst enemy in doing so. <strong>Every day might be your last</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "A mysterious fog has fallen over Rock Valley. Strangers speak half-truth over the radio. Expose the lies, or remain silent forever.",
